<lb n="47"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ufferzogen</unclear> werden <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">möchte</unclear>, gantz ernste-
<lb n="48"/>lich pitende, üch deßen schriftlich.
<lb n="49"/>zeberichten, damit diß kind, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sinen</unclear> ehr-
<lb n="50"/>lichen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nechsten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verwanten</unclear>, alß die
<lb n="51"/>sich <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">deßen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">anznemmen</unclear> haben, zuokom-
<lb n="52"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">en</unclear> und in <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ehren</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuo</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sinem</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eignen</unclear>
<lb n="53"/>heil ufferzogen werden möge. Wan
<lb n="54"/>wir nun diß <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guotmuetig</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">begähren</unclear>,
<lb n="55"/>(da wir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unß</unclear> sonsten <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">one</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">daß</unclear>, der ge-
