<lb n="57"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ghört</unclear>. Alß haben wir üch <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">deßen</unclear>
<lb n="58"/>hieby, bester nachbarlicher und ge-
<lb n="59"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">threuwer</unclear> eidgnößischer <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wohl</unclear>-
<lb n="60"/>meinung <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuberichten</unclear> nit underlaßen
<lb n="61"/>wöllen, mit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sehr</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wolgemeintem</unclear>
<lb n="62"/>piten, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">solliches</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">von</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unß</unclear> zum besten
<lb n="63"/>zuverstahn. Herannach gschicht Gott
<lb n="64"/>dem <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">allmechtigen</unclear>, (dene <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wir</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">üch</unclear> woll
